ngine/godot-proposals/issues/7176\r\nAlso Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6429\r\n\r\nThis adds `set_action_disabled()` and `is_action_disabled()` methods.\r\nSetting the action to disabled ignores user input while still allowing overriding via simulated input. This also doesn't prevent `InputEvent`s generated for `_input()`. They can be filtered by checking\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\r\n    if event.is_action(\"MyAction\") && !Input.is_action_disabled(\"MyAction\"):\r\n        # logic\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm not very familiar with the input inner-workings, so this may be a naive approach, but I've been trying it out and haven't seen any issues. If someone more familiar could let me know if I'm missing something major, I'd appreciate it.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-15T15:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T19:59:39Z","closed_at":"2026-02-16T18:46:59Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"markdibarry:add-input-disabled","ref":"add-input-disabled","repo":{"id":449915167,"node_id":"R_kgDOGtEpHw","name":"godot","full_name":"markdibarry/godot","owner":{"login":"markdibarry","id":2132